# RIPE++ clone. Third party, and under a Fraunhofer ACADEMIC-USE licence that
# forbids commercial use -- it does not belong in this repo's history. Clone it
# yourself, or set RIPEPP_ROOT. geoanchor/methods.py::RIPEppMethod finds it.
ripepp/

# Trained covariance models. Small (260 KB) and reproducible from
